  "description": "Sistina had a nice, quiet life, flying around on her broomstick and delivering delicious bread. But when the emperor dies, this unassuming witch learns she’s his granddaughter and now she’s tasked with running the empire! With all the tips and tricks she’s learned through her bakery, she's starting to get a taste of how to get it all done… but she still has to figure out her destiny as a witch, and then there’s this knight she can’t figure out, too! Will she find a recipe for success to take care of the empire, her fate, and maybe even her love life?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
